    "title": "phibble workloads at 1,000,000 rows",
    "label": "phibble workloads",
    "description": "phibble's shared benchmark workloads on an events table of 1,000,000 rows (id, key with 10,000 values, g with 8 labels, x with about 2% missing, and a datetime t) and a dims table of 100,000 rows. Each workload runs as a phplyr pipeline and as the equivalent direct phibble Table calls, which shows the time phplyr adds. Data from bench/generate.php, with phibble's generator and seed.",
